Vendored libraries
------------------
third_party/gopus is github.com/thesyncim/gopus v0.1.2 (BSD-3-Clause) with its CELT
table built lazily. third_party/go-mp3 is github.com/hajimehoshi/go-mp3 (Apache-2.0)
with its decoding tables built lazily. Both changes only move work from process
start-up to first use; licence files are kept in each directory.
